# Arc turns Developer Mode on by itself for local servers, on any port (#228). With the toolbar
# hidden (Niche's default), a localhost page shows the developer bar straight away; the snapshot
# fails when no PaneToolbarView is on screen. ${WEBKIT} is the fixture server as localhost.
# promise: #228
budget rss=600 stalls50=6
port 47126
niche://debug?windowSize=1280x800
niche://open?url=${WEBKIT}/page.html?n=localhost
expect-log loaded localhost \(HTTP 200\)
wait 3
snapshot PaneToolbarView localhost-developer-bar
